msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Hey, you're that fella from a little bit ago. I've been walkin' around this "
"city, but I can't figure out what's what..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Think you could show me around a little?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Sorry. I've got things to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Hey, I understand... Maybe I'll figure out where I am eventually. Might be "
"a while off, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Sure thing. I'll show you around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "I appreciate that. I don't even know any good places to eat here anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "So... anywhere you wanna go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"I wanna check out that humongous building. It wasn't even built when I was "
"here last."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "The Millennium Tower? Sure, let's go take a look."
msgstr ""

